## The local passwords in this repository

The credentials that appear in this repository — `raptor_local_dev_only` and
the seeded account addresses — are development constants for a PostgreSQL
instance bound to loopback. They unlock nothing else, and they are not
secrets. Every real secret (`BETTER_AUTH_SECRET`, `PAYLOAD_SECRET`, database
passwords, API keys) is environment-supplied, gitignored, and refused by the
code when it is missing, empty or a known placeholder.

## Changing this

If the owner publishes an open-source license for this repository, it replaces
